WEBVTT

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:12.379
Gawat, kan?

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:13.847
Parah, kan?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.281
Gawat kan?

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:17.083
Gawat banget, kan?

